Python Digital Clock

About the Project

The Digital Clock is a beginner-friendly Python project that displays the current time and date in a graphical window.

Features

- Displays the current time
- Updates every second
- Displays the current date
- Simple graphical user interface
- Easy-to-use clock window

Technologies Used

- Python 3
- Tkinter
- Datetime module

How to Run

1. Install Python 3 on your computer.
2. Download or clone this repository.
3. Open a terminal in the project folder.
4. Run the command:

python main.py

On Windows, you can also try "py main.py". On macOS or Linux, try "python3 main.py".

